Rule 19 (dtype of out must be float32 or float64 if dtype of A is float32 or float64 respectively, and complex64 or complex128 if dtype of A is complex64 or complex128, respectively.)
{A: tensor, out: tensor} |= (dtype_(A) = 7 ∧ dtype_(out) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 8 ∧ dtype_(out) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 9 ∧ dtype_(out) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 10 ∧ dtype_(out) = 10)
