Rule 20 (A must have dtype float32, float64, complex64, or complex128)
{A: tensor} |= dtype_(A) = 7 ∨ dtype_(A) = 8 ∨ dtype_(A) = 9 ∨ dtype_(A) = 10
>>
Rule 21 (The input tensor A must have at least 2 dimensions, its last two dimensions must be equal and greater than zero, and its dtype must be float32, float64, complex64, or complex128)
{A: tensor} |= ndim(A) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(A, ndim(A) - 1) = shape(A, ndim(A) - 2) ∧ shape(A, ndim(A) - 1) > 0 ∧ (dtype_(A) = 7 ∨ dtype_(A) = 8 ∨ dtype_(A) = 9 ∨ dtype_(A) = 10)
>>
Rule 22 (If out is given, its shape must match the shape of A, removing the last two dimensions if A has more than 2 dimensions, or being a scalar if A has 2 dimensions, AND its dtype must match the dtype of A.)
{A: tensor, out: tensor} |= if ndim(A) > 2 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(A) - 2] : shape(A, i) = shape(out, i) ∧ ((dtype_(A) = 7 ∧ dtype_(out) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 8 ∧ dtype_(out) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 9 ∧ dtype_(out) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 10 ∧ dtype_(out) = 10))) else (ndim(out) = 0 ∧ ((dtype_(A) = 7 ∧ dtype_(out) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 8 ∧ dtype_(out) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 9 ∧ dtype_(out) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 10 ∧ dtype_(out) = 10)))
>>
Rule 23 (If A's last two dimensions are n, then n > 0)
{A: tensor} |= shape(A, ndim(A) - 1) > 0
>>
Rule 25 (If out is provided, check if A's dtype is compatible)
{A: tensor, out: tensor} |= (dtype_(A) = 7 ∧ (dtype_(out) = 7 ∨ dtype_(out) = 8)) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 8 ∧ dtype_(out) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 9 ∧ (dtype_(out) = 9 ∨ dtype_(out) = 10)) ∨ (dtype_(A) = 10 ∧ dtype_(out) = 10)
